          "Engage the under-30, college-educated subset directly: the 32.1 median age in an affluent district creates a cohort of younger professionals and families who are not ideologically inherited Republicans and who will evaluate on economic opportunity, education quality, and whether government is delivering value. This group is the swing margin in a 80-20 district.",
