          "Build authentic relationships with Black (11.69%) and Hispanic (8.39%) communities through specific governance action on economic mobility, healthcare access, and racial equity — not through periodic outreach; these communities are large enough to anchor the Democratic coalition and responsive to whether they perceive sustained commitment or electoral tokenism.",
