          "Identify and engage the 7.3% AIAN gap as an active constituency: whether this represents a tribal nation's territory-adjacent population or a distinct AIAN community within the district, these residents deserve legislative attention on healthcare access, water rights, and economic opportunity rather than assumption that a 100-0 unopposed result indicates complete constituent alignment.",
